{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>These are the appointed times of YHWH.</b> That you are obligated to offer on them a fire-offering. The meaning is that in all of them there is burnt offering and meal offering, sacrifice and libations, for until now he mentioned only a fire-offering alone, and it is possible that it be a burnt offering alone or a meal offering alone."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:59.733048059Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}